Which index should I use?






flowchart TD
    A["What does the query ask?"] --&gt; B{"Exact key or a range?"}
    B -- "yes" --&gt; C["B+Tree (the default)"]
    B -- "exact key only, never ranges" --&gt; C2["Hash index"]
    A --&gt; D{"Is this key in the set at all?"}
    D -- "yes" --&gt; E["Bloom / cuckoo filter in front of the real lookup"]
    A --&gt; F{"Words inside text?"}
    F -- "yes" --&gt; G["Inverted index"]
    A --&gt; H{"Similar by meaning?"}
    H -- "yes" --&gt; I["Vector index (IVF or HNSW)"]
    A --&gt; J{"In-memory ordered data with high concurrency?"}
    J -- "yes" --&gt; K["Skip list"]
    A --&gt; L{"Long, prefix-sharing keys?"}
    L -- "yes" --&gt; M["Trie / radix tree (e.g. ART)"]


 A rough guide to choosing an index.
